      "text": "-> Every constructor arguement need seperate constructor-arg .\n\n-> If an instance variable is final then constructor injection is necessary.\n\n-> Contructor injection also support primitive values and Wrapper classes .\n\n-> When there are are overloaded constructor in class which include String Constructor the value\npassed will always run String constructor because it is directly matched with String as value passed\nusing xml is in the form of text . --> Spring-DIEx-2 .\n\n-> Solution use atrribute type to specify which constructor to run --> Spring-DIE-3 .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> Every constructor arguement need seperate constructor-arg .\n\n-> If an instance variable is final then constructor injection is necessary.\n\n-> Contructor injection also support primitive values and Wrapper classes .\n\n-> When there are are overloaded constructor in class which include String Constructor the value passed will always run String constructor because it is directly matched with String as value passed using xml is in the form of text . --> Spring-DIEx-2 .\n\n-> Solution use atrribute type to specify which constructor to run --> Spring-DIE-3 .",
